{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooty Squad is a fast paced, competitive first person shooter with hilarious graphics and ragdoll physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of guns from machine guns, snipers or even RPG's. Beating your opponent will take not only quick reflexes, but being smart about how you play !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning the location and advantages of each gun, will be the key to winning against your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has been designed with keeping the game as balanced as possible. Each map will have its own unique flow and personality !</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"5eb0820c2fd0645a20a0416cc6ad5ae76e232a16.jpg","localized_name":"Beginner","name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/681060/5eb0820c2fd0645a20a0416cc6ad5ae76e232a16.jpg"},{"icon":"b8cf7a566e9cb60b5b4dd31c57c7b91d83438f80.jpg","localized_name":"Killer !","name":"Killer !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/681060/b8cf7a566e9cb60b5b4dd31c57c7b91d83438f80.jpg"},{"icon":"43567494091e2d6cd5103a9f8a5149cf7a033ae9.jpg","localized_name":"Blood Bath !","name":"Blood Bath !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/681060/43567494091e2d6cd5103a9f8a5149cf7a033ae9.jpg"},{"icon":"bec6a0a04f9117d9102a6e17136b1a7126382065.jpg","localized_name":"I bet you were carried !","name":"I bet you were carried !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/681060/bec6a0a04f9117d9102a6e17136b1a7126382065.jpg"},{"icon":"a99f0338bf1cfd0ae7f3cca142b7753b0f7e4985.jpg","localized_name":"Hey ! That's pretty good","name":"Hey ! That's pretty good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/681060/a99f0338bf1cfd0ae7f3cca142b7753b0f7e4985.jpg"},{"icon":"38aaf57b25caf18ab3ed63ad6a